Package: strictdoc-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: StrictDoc maintainers <https://github.com/strictdoc-project/strictdoc>
Depends: git, ca-certificates, libreadline8, libpcre3, libglib2.0-0, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libegl1, libgl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxext6, libxkbcommon0, libpulse0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbfile1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxfixes3, libxrandr2, libxtst6, libnss3, libnspr4, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libdrm2, libgbm1, libcups2 | libcups2t64, libatk1.0-0 | libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0 | libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libxshmfence1
Description: StrictDoc desktop application
 StrictDoc in a window of its own, to write requirements and documents and
 share them with a team. The package carries its own headless Chrome for the
 PDF export.
